      "content": "The struggle to find meaning when facing such massive, systemic despair is profoundly human, and your honesty about the futility feels very real. If the scale of the problem is too vast to fix, perhaps the focus shifts from 'building a future' to 'how to be present with the reality.' Accepting the harshness doesn't necessarily mean surrendering; it can sometimes be the starting point for finding a quiet, deeply authentic way to exist right now.",
      "source": "target",
